{"paper": "2022-Tier1-3-Dec-2022-Shift3.pdf", "status": "ok", "mode": "sequential", "splitter": "qdot", "section_slice": true, "extracted_count": 25, "tagged_count": 25, "questions": [{"n": 1, "text": "The radius of a right circular cylinder is thrice of its height. If the height of the cylinder is 2.1 cm, then what is the volume of cylinder?", "options": [{"text": "224.65 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "194.72 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "324.86 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "261.95 cm3", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "cylinder", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 2, "text": "5 men and 8 women can complete a work in 12 days working together, while 3 men and 7 women together can complete the same work in 15 days. In how many days will 11 women complete the same work?", "options": [{"text": "12", "added": false}, {"text": "8", "added": false}, {"text": "6", "added": false}, {"text": "16", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Work", "sub": "together-apart", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 3, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "The average wage of the employees lie between 80-90.", "added": false}, {"text": "The average wage of the employees lie between 110-120.", "added": false}, {"text": "The average wage of the employees lie between 100-110.", "added": false}, {"text": "The average wage of the employees lie between 90-100.", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Average", "sub": "simple-average", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 4, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "5.55", "added": false}, {"text": "–6.83", "added": false}, {"text": "–5.58", "added": false}, {"text": "6.83", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 5, "text": "A man bought a watch for 12% discount. If he had bought it for 24% discount, he would have got the watch for ₹2400 less. The marked price of the watch is:", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Discount", "sub": "single-discount", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 6, "text": "If the price of salt decreases by 20%, then by what percentage should consumption be increased to keep the expenditure same?", "options": [{"text": "26%", "added": false}, {"text": "27%", "added": false}, {"text": "25%", "added": false}, {"text": "24%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "basic-percentage", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 7, "text": "A solid copper sphere of radius 9 cm is hammered and moulded into a wire of radius 2 cm. What is the length of this wire?", "options": [{"text": "224 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "183 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "198 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "243 cm", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "sphere-hemisphere", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 8, "text": "Which smallest positive number should be subtracted from each of 9 and 13 so that 18 is the third proportion to them?", "options": [{"text": "2", "added": false}, {"text": "4", "added": false}, {"text": "3", "added": false}, {"text": "1", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Ratio-Proportion", "sub": "ratio-basics", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 9, "text": "A company employed 700 men and 300 women and the average wage was Rs.450 per day. If a man got Rs.50 more than a woman, then the daily wage of the woman is:", "options": [{"text": "Rs.350", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.375", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.415", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.435", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Average", "sub": "simple-average", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 10, "text": "A,B,C are three angles of a triangle. If A - B = 45° and B - C = 15° then ∠ A = ?", "options": [{"text": "83°", "added": false}, {"text": 