ions_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Speed-Distance", "sub": "relative-speed", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 16, "text": "A number when divided by 7 leaves remainder of 4. If the square of the same number is divided by 7, then what is the remainder?", "options": [{"text": "3", "added": false}, {"text": "1", "added": false}, {"text": "4", "added": false}, {"text": "2", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Number System", "sub": "remainder", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 17, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "141", "added": false}, {"text": "140", "added": false}, {"text": "142", "added": false}, {"text": "143", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 18, "text": "If cot B = 9, then what will be the value of sec2 B?", "options": [{"text": "98/81", "added": false}, {"text": "92/81", "added": false}, {"text": "42/81", "added": false}, {"text": "82/81", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Trigonometry", "sub": "ratios-and-tables", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 19, "text": "मान लीिवजO एक कृU का क5 ैै और P कृU के बाैर एक िवबंद ैै। ययद PAB, कृU का एक छे दक ैै जोकवU को A और B पर कवाता ैव और PT, P सव तवची गई 4शरव ता ैव, तो PT की लवबवई ]वत कीिजए। PA = 3 cm और AB = 9 cm ैै। ´", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Circles-Polygons", "sub": "tangents-and-chords", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 20, "text": "The value of 95 × 105 is:", "options": [{"text": "9981", "added": false}, {"text": "9935", "added": false}, {"text": "9965", "added": false}, {"text": "9975", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "bodmas", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 21, "text": "The LCM of two numbers is 120 and the numbers are in the ratio 3 : 8. The sum of the numbers will be:", "options": [{"text": "48", "added": false}, {"text": "55", "added": false}, {"text": "45", "added": false}, {"text": "60", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "HCF-LCM", "sub": "hcf-lcm-of-numbers", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 22, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 23, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "952", "added": false}, {"text": "1152", "added": false}, {"text": "1052", "added": false}, {"text": "852", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 24, "text": "Suppose ΔABC be a right-angled triangle where ∠ A = 90° and AD ⊥ BC. If area (ΔABC) = 80 cm2 and BC = 16 cm, then the length of AD is:", "options": [{"text": "10 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "24 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "18 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "12 cm", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 2D", "sub": "triangle-and-quadrilaterals", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 25, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "125 kg", "added": false}, {"text": "100 kg", "added": false}, {"text": "50 kg", "added": false}, {"text": "75 kg", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}]}